# RSF03-03: the check while the visitor types.
title The box in the form checks the browser while the visitor types; the form, files included, goes straight through
row  type:box "The visitor types" "first input" | box:warnbox "The box" "fetches a task, solves it" | send:okbox "The form is sent" "with the answer, files too"
row  site:okbox "Your site" "never sees the answer"
arrow type -> box
arrow box -> send "✓ checked" go
arrow send -> site "the shield takes the answer out" go
note Without JavaScript the form is sent without an answer, and the check page comes as before.
